description	"Baylan Skoll

An imposing Dark Jedi with heavy hitting and focused strikes.

^2Weaponry:
- Lightsaber (Red/Yellow Style)
-- Saber Defense (3) 
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (3)
-- Saber Throw (2)
-- Cripples/Staggers On Hit
-- 2 Swing Limit
-- 15% Longer Length

